```mermaid
flowchart TD
    IDEA[Project Idea Analysis] --> REQUIREMENTS[Extract Requirements]

    REQUIREMENTS --> APP_TYPE{Application Type?}
    REQUIREMENTS --> COMPLEXITY{Complexity Level?}
    REQUIREMENTS --> PERFORMANCE{Performance Needs?}
    REQUIREMENTS --> SCALE{Scale Requirements?}

    %% Application Type Detection
    APP_TYPE --> STATIC[Static Website<br/>• Portfolio<br/>• Documentation<br/>• Landing page]
    APP_TYPE --> SPA[Single Page App<br/>• Dashboard<br/>• Admin panel<br/>• Interactive UI]
    APP_TYPE --> FULLSTACK[Full-Stack App<br/>• User auth<br/>• Database<br/>• API endpoints]
    APP_TYPE --> API[API Service<br/>• Backend only<br/>• Microservice<br/>• Integration]

    %% Complexity Analysis
    COMPLEXITY --> SIMPLE[Simple<br/>• Basic CRUD<br/>• Few features<br/>• Minimal logic]
    COMPLEXITY --> MODERATE[Moderate<br/>• Multiple entities<br/>• Business logic<br/>• Integrations]
    COMPLEXITY --> COMPLEX[Complex<br/>• Advanced workflows<br/>• Real-time features<br/>• Multi-tenancy]

    %% Performance Requirements
    PERFORMANCE --> STANDARD[Standard<br/>• <3s load time<br/>• Basic responsiveness<br/>• Occasional usage]
    PERFORMANCE --> HIGH[High Performance<br/>• <1s load time<br/>• Real-time updates<br/>• Heavy traffic]
    PERFORMANCE --> REALTIME[Real-Time<br/>• <100ms response<br/>• WebSocket/SSE<br/>• Live collaboration]

    %% Stack Selection Matrix
    STATIC --> STATIC_STACK[🎨 Static Stack<br/>• Framework: Next.js SSG / Astro<br/>• Styling: Tailwind CSS<br/>• Build: Vite / Next.js<br/>• Deploy: Vercel / Netlify]

    SPA --> SPA_STACK[⚛️ SPA Stack<br/>• Framework: React / Vue / Svelte<br/>• State: Zustand / Pinia / Stores<br/>• Routing: React Router / Vue Router<br/>• Build: Vite / Webpack]

    FULLSTACK --> STACK_CHOICE{Choose Stack Pattern}

    API --> API_STACK[🔧 API Stack<br/>• Runtime: Node.js / Python / Go<br/>• Framework: Express / FastAPI / Gin<br/>• Database: PostgreSQL / MongoDB<br/>• ORM: Prisma / SQLAlchemy / GORM]

    %% Full-Stack Options
    STACK_CHOICE --> JS_STACK[JavaScript Stack]
    STACK_CHOICE --> PYTHON_STACK[Python Stack]
    STACK_CHOICE --> POLYGLOT[Polyglot Stack]

    %% JavaScript Full-Stack
    JS_STACK --> SIMPLE_JS{Complexity?}
    SIMPLE_JS -->|Simple| NEXTJS_SIMPLE[Next.js Full-Stack<br/>• Framework: Next.js 14<br/>• Database: SQLite / PostgreSQL<br/>• ORM: Prisma<br/>• Auth: NextAuth.js<br/>• Styling: Tailwind CSS]

    SIMPLE_JS -->|Moderate/Complex| NEXTJS_COMPLEX[Next.js + Separate Backend<br/>• Frontend: Next.js<br/>• Backend: Express / Fastify<br/>• Database: PostgreSQL<br/>• ORM: Prisma<br/>• Auth: JWT / OAuth]

    %% Python Full-Stack
    PYTHON_STACK --> PYTHON_CHOICE{Frontend Preference?}
    PYTHON_CHOICE -->|React Frontend| REACT_PYTHON[React + Python<br/>• Frontend: React / Next.js<br/>• Backend: FastAPI<br/>• Database: PostgreSQL<br/>• ORM: SQLAlchemy<br/>• Auth: JWT / OAuth2]

    PYTHON_CHOICE -->|Python Frontend| DJANGO_STACK[Django Full-Stack<br/>• Framework: Django<br/>• Frontend: Django templates + HTMX<br/>• Database: PostgreSQL<br/>• Auth: Django Auth<br/>• Admin: Django Admin]

    %% Database Selection
    NEXTJS_SIMPLE --> DB_CHOICE{Database Needs?}
    NEXTJS_COMPLEX --> DB_CHOICE
    REACT_PYTHON --> DB_CHOICE
    DJANGO_STACK --> DB_CHOICE
    API_STACK --> DB_CHOICE

    DB_CHOICE --> DB_SIMPLE[Simple Needs<br/>SQLite / localStorage]
    DB_CHOICE --> DB_RELATIONAL[Relational Data<br/>PostgreSQL / MySQL]
    DB_CHOICE --> DB_NOSQL[Document/Flexible<br/>MongoDB / Supabase]
    DB_CHOICE --> DB_VECTOR[AI/Search Features<br/>PostgreSQL + pgvector]

    %% Authentication Strategy
    DB_SIMPLE --> AUTH_CHOICE{Auth Requirements?}
    DB_RELATIONAL --> AUTH_CHOICE
    DB_NOSQL --> AUTH_CHOICE
    DB_VECTOR --> AUTH_CHOICE

    AUTH_CHOICE --> AUTH_NONE[No Auth Required<br/>Public access only]
    AUTH_CHOICE --> AUTH_SIMPLE[Simple Auth<br/>NextAuth.js / Clerk]
    AUTH_CHOICE --> AUTH_ENTERPRISE[Enterprise Auth<br/>Auth0 / OIDC / SAML]

    %% Deployment Strategy
    AUTH_NONE --> DEPLOY_CHOICE[Deployment Strategy]
    AUTH_SIMPLE --> DEPLOY_CHOICE
    AUTH_ENTERPRISE --> DEPLOY_CHOICE

    DEPLOY_CHOICE --> DEPLOY_SIMPLE[Simple Deployment<br/>• Frontend: Vercel/Netlify<br/>• Backend: Railway/Render<br/>• Database: Neon/PlanetScale]

    DEPLOY_CHOICE --> DEPLOY_ENTERPRISE[Enterprise Deployment<br/>• Cloud: AWS/GCP/Azure<br/>• Containers: Docker/K8s<br/>• Infrastructure: Terraform<br/>• CI/CD: GitHub Actions]

    %% AI Success Scoring
    DEPLOY_SIMPLE --> AI_SCORE[🤖 AI Success Scoring]
    DEPLOY_ENTERPRISE --> AI_SCORE

    AI_SCORE --> SCORE_FACTORS[Scoring Factors:<br/>• Stack familiarity (weight: 30%)<br/>• Complexity match (weight: 25%)<br/>• Performance capability (weight: 20%)<br/>• Deployment simplicity (weight: 15%)<br/>• Community support (weight: 10%)]

    SCORE_FACTORS --> FINAL_SCORE[Final AI Score<br/>• 9.0-10.0: Optimal choice<br/>• 8.0-8.9: Good choice<br/>• 7.0-7.9: Acceptable choice<br/>• <7.0: Consider alternatives]

    FINAL_SCORE --> RECOMMENDATION[📋 Technology Recommendation<br/>• Selected stack with reasoning<br/>• Expected development time<br/>• Performance characteristics<br/>• Deployment options<br/>• Risk assessment<br/>• Success probability]

    %% Dynamic Adjustments
    RECOMMENDATION --> ADJUSTMENT{Constraints Detected?}
    ADJUSTMENT -->|Budget Constraints| BUDGET_ADJUST[Optimize for cost<br/>• Prefer free tiers<br/>• Minimize services<br/>• Choose open source]

    ADJUSTMENT -->|Time Constraints| TIME_ADJUST[Optimize for speed<br/>• Proven patterns<br/>• Minimal setup<br/>• Fast deployment]

    ADJUSTMENT -->|Performance Constraints| PERF_ADJUST[Optimize for performance<br/>• Fast frameworks<br/>• Efficient databases<br/>• CDN integration]

    ADJUSTMENT -->|None| FINAL_STACK[✅ Final Stack Selection]

    BUDGET_ADJUST --> FINAL_STACK
    TIME_ADJUST --> FINAL_STACK
    PERF_ADJUST --> FINAL_STACK

    FINAL_STACK --> ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS[📐 Architecture Decision Records<br/>• Technology justifications<br/>• Trade-off analysis<br/>• Performance implications<br/>• Scalability considerations<br/>• Security measures]

    %% Style classes
    classDef frontend fill:#61DAFB,stroke:#20232A,stroke-width:2px
    classDef backend fill:#68A063,stroke:#2D3748,stroke-width:2px
    classDef database fill:#336791,stroke:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px
    classDef deployment fill:#FF9900,stroke:#232F3E,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ai_scoring fill:#FF6B6B,stroke:#CC0000,stroke-width:2px

    class STATIC_STACK,SPA_STACK,NEXTJS_SIMPLE,NEXTJS_COMPLEX,REACT_PYTHON,DJANGO_STACK frontend
    class API_STACK,PYTHON_STACK,JS_STACK backend
    class DB_SIMPLE,DB_RELATIONAL,DB_NOSQL,DB_VECTOR database
    class DEPLOY_SIMPLE,DEPLOY_ENTERPRISE deployment
    class AI_SCORE,SCORE_FACTORS,FINAL_SCORE,RECOMMENDATION ai_scoring
```